    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d515">

                <pb facs="0881" n="834" xml:id="pg834"/>

                <head>515. Telegram 1585 from Geneva<anchor n="1" xml:id="d515-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Geneva</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1956-03-03">March 3, 1956, 11
                        a.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <pb facs="d515-1" n="1" type="facsimile" xml:id="d515-1"/>
                <p>1585. From Osborn.</p>
                <p>According information from reporters, statement being released at (repeat at)
                    Chinese Communist Consulate General 3:30 p.m. local time today.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">Gowen</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d515-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d515-f1-content">
                <p>Source: Department of State, Central Files, 611.93/3–356. Official Use Only;
                    Priority. Originally received as telegram 1538 but corrected to 1585. Repeated
                    for information Priority to Prague for Ambassador Johnson as telegram 26.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
